## Step 2: Start Adding Storage

1. Click **Add**.
2. A list of supported storage types is displayed.

Available options may include:

* Directory
* LVM
* LVM-Thin
* ZFS over iSCSI
* NFS
* SMB/CIFS
* CephFS
* RBD
* ESXi
* iSCSI

> **Note:** The available storage types depend on your VM2Cloud installation and enabled features.

